{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_harold_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_harold_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "老兵的义肢",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_harold_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c7c2aed9162a6a71d2b93c415dac5b258464fd73fe7232928a6bcb63b4ad9080",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g11_snowylane"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "里斯本那个混账，把我们喊来帮忙放牧，自己不知道跟姑娘跑哪儿去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你说，里斯本不会真打算在谢拉格成家吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你之前不是撺掇得最厉害吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这会儿开始担心兄弟真成了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这是担心他被骗了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢拉格人这么淳朴，我们骗他们还差不多，还他们骗里斯本，省省吧，你小子就是嫉妒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那不能这么说，我们可是士兵，保家卫国是我们的天职，被骗进温柔乡难道不也是一种骗吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望你下次述职的时候也能喊这么大声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望你下次述职的时候嘴巴也能这么毒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放你的牧去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，在这里放牧一辈子，总比回去打仗强。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪有这种好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还真别说，前几天头儿收到了公爵阁下的来信，虽然不知道信上写了什么，但头儿这几天可是一直在念叨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "念叨什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“罗德岛”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗，我看他每天念叨的还是他的宝贝驮兽。喏——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，好孩子，放松，放松。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温顺的驮兽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（虚弱的叫声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错，就是这样，好孩子，不会疼的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "温顺的驮兽",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（吃痛的叫声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，兰兰，别紧张，别怕——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "吃痛的驮兽向哈洛德的方向迈了两步，正在安抚驮兽的哈洛德连忙躲闪，却还是慢了一步。\n“喀啦”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他低头看去，看到的是义肢的残骸。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阴沉的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_414_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杰克。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈......抱歉，头儿，我知道您肯定要让我去医院跑腿，能不能让我先笑完？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我确实是要让你跑腿，不过我要你跑的不是医院。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为啥？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在刚来的时候就调查过了，谢拉格的医院没有能帮我修义肢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我要去哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能帮我修的，恐怕只有罗德岛了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛......但是，那边跟我们可不太对付啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就是因为不太对付，所以才要去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这可是你们不用回去打仗，我不用回去应付那些贵族的最后机会了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "油滑的士兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_408_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的假的？那我立刻就去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g9_manoravenue"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈洛德先生，我们请工程部的同事看了一下您的义肢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它在被踩碎前内部结构就已经濒临崩溃了，不然的话，驮兽虽然很重，却也不至于把它踩坏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟在那之前，它可是面对了比驮兽强大百倍的存在呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "各位专家怎么看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这里有一个好消息和一个坏消息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您先说好消息吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好消息是，罗德岛刚引进的新设备，确实可以维修您的义肢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我猜，坏消息恐怕是，没有材料？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，罗德岛和喀兰贸易的合同中包含了这种材料的交易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么......是缺乏人手？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，是的，您的义肢采用的技术过于先进，派驻谢拉格的干员里没有掌握这种技术的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那真是遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，看来时隔多年，我的手杖又要发挥它本来的作用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这样的，有一位本舰工程部的干员现在正在谢拉格旅游。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过她正在休假中，来到谢拉格后并没有和办事处这边接触，所以我们也不清楚她的具体行程安排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果能联络上她，或许可以请她帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我去找吧。有什么线索吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔......讯使先生之前提到过他给她的同伴送了些货物，或许他知道些什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讯使，魏斯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这倒是给我出了个难题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您要是不方便的话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，让我去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，您的腿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，我拄手杖的时间，可不比装义肢的时间要短。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_088",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "银灰先生，我按照你的要求告诉他了，他确实自己去了，这样就可以了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我和博士聊过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然他想借这个机会接近罗德岛，那么，我们不过是做些顺水推舟的事情罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈洛德不会不知道这一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩希欧迪斯",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下的，就看他自己了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "45_g1_kjeragtrainstation"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车站员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_273_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯先生，你今天也来啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，过一阵子我要跟老爷去罗德岛待一段时间，最近就打算多来这边帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车站员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_273_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "车站员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_273_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，有一位老先生在这边等你很久了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯先生，好久不见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "子爵阁下，久疏问候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还以为您已经离开谢拉格了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，魏斯先生说笑了，我的一举一动不都在您的视线范围内吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您不会不知道，老爷早把监视给撤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也乐得清闲，至少不用担心被人敲闷棍了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯先生性情直爽，我不讨厌和您这样的人打交道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，您有什么事竟然需要来找我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是这样的，我正在寻找一名罗德岛工匠大师，想请她帮我修理我的义肢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说您知道她在哪里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我大概知道您说的是谁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，当然，我也不打算轻易从您的口中得到情报。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已经和车站的人商量过了，只要我的义肢能够修好，我就来协助您送信，如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，我不能轻易地把罗德岛干员的情报透露给一个维多利亚军人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "45_g6_lakescenery_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，果然没那么轻松。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的话，怕是只能让杰克他们跑一跑了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，不行，现在让他们露面，只会引起误解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德&忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？这位女士，发生了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......没什么，就是工作压力太大了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我感觉我快要撑不住了，但是，我又不能失去这份工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "人生总是身不由己，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天是个难得的假期，但是，我平时几乎没有娱乐，就算放假了也只能像个傻瓜一样坐在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样的生活有什么乐趣呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "女士，你对舞蹈感兴趣吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一般般吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，你有兴趣欣赏一个残疾人的舞蹈吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？但是，你的腿——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁说断了一条腿就不能跳舞了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈洛德不再说话，只是拄着手杖，来到女孩面前，向她行了一个绅士礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "随着女孩的惊呼，哈洛德挥舞着手杖开始了舞蹈。\n他先是围绕着手杖，跳出轻盈的舞步。\n手杖与皮鞋不时与地面敲击，发出有节奏的声响，与周边店铺中播放的音乐完美融合。\n不仅如此，到高潮处，他还将手杖向上扔起，手杖在空中旋转，然后被他稳稳接住，如同杂技一般引得女孩连连喝彩。\n女孩也受到了哈洛德的感染，站起来加入了他，和他一起舞动了起来。\n不知不觉间，周围的路人都被哈洛德吸引过来，有的欣赏，有的干脆加入了他们。\n一时间，广场上变得热闹不已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "与其犹豫，不如加入，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您说得对！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "随着音乐渐停，哈洛德打算用一个华丽的抛手杖作为谢幕。\n然而——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（糟了——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "47_g14_skyovercast_L2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "许是生疏了，又或者是被热闹的氛围冲昏了头脑，在最后，他的手不慎滑了一下。\n手杖在空中划出了一道美丽的弧线，然而，它却向着一个哈洛德一时间无法够到的位置落去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼看这场秀要以一个惨淡的失败作为落幕，一道身影如闪电般划过，在半空中轻轻撞了一下手杖。\n手杖立刻改变了轨道，并稳稳地落入了哈洛德手中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "45_g6_lakescenery_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈洛德顺势向周围行了一个礼，作为演出的谢幕。\n一时间，掌声雷动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也可以变成您这样吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么要变成我这样呢，女士，你有健全的双腿、美丽的容颜、充足的时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你一定可以变得比我更好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "不再忧郁的路人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_280_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我会试试看，谢谢您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能让你这样的年轻人获得一些勇气是我的荣幸，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及......锏女士，您看了多久了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在附近吃饭，正好看到而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "跳得不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，为了进入社交场，不得不做了些努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些贵族喜欢拿我的腿开玩笑，我就干脆向我夫人好好学习了一番。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，老哈洛德在舞蹈上有一“腿”也算是我小小的招牌了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "腿怎么回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，义肢因公殉职，原因吗，想必您不会不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦......居然扛到了现在，质量不错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没法修？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有一位罗德岛的技术专家修得了，不过魏斯先生不愿意为我带路，这不就只能在这里唉声叹气了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你唉声叹气的是找不到工匠，还是搭不上罗德岛的关系？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......锏女士，您要是踏入社交场，一定是个可怕的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，既然你看起来很闲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "科伦多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了，老大？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下午你爹那边播种不是缺人吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和角峰说一声，这位维多利亚老兵要去帮忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（等等，角峰......这或许确实是个突破口。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（况且，这位也是迟早要面对的。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锏",
      "speakerId": "avg_4116_blkkgt_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去不去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，我不得不重复一下刚才的那句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锏女士，您要是踏入社交场，一定是个可怕的存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g1_snowyforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "锏说老爷找她，她抽不开身，所以让这位过来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "强壮的青年",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_277_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "久疏问候，角峰先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别的我就不多问了，你会种田吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，如果有空，我都会亲自去领地里的耕地上帮忙干农活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "田野对老哈洛德而言，是最亲密的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，不过，角峰先生，请稍等片刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果要下地的话，那么手杖未免有些太碍事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想向你要一些东西，做一具简易的义肢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你需要什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一些木头，一把小刀，一些棉花，一根绳子，就这么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些就可以做一副义肢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "角峰感到有些不可思议，但哈洛德一脸理所当然地开始了行动。\n他先挑了一块圆柱状的细木头，比量了一下自己断肢的长度，然后两头削平，用来当作义肢的“腿”。\n然后，他又挑了一块圆形的扁平木头，在中间挖了个孔，将“腿”嵌入其中，一个简单到不能更简单的“义肢”雏形就算完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你做过这样的义肢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然军队也会配给义肢，但是战场形势瞬息万变，一旦义肢出问题，哪有那么多功夫去修。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种时候，这种简单却又实用的义肢至少可以不拖累行军。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，义肢的价格可不便宜，尤其是军人，对义肢的要求更高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈洛德一边说着，一边再把一块木头削成碗的形状，用棉花填满里面。\n然后，他将腿塞入碗中，并用绳子把碗和义肢绑在一起，最后再打一个死结。\n而后他站起来走动两步，转了个圈，向角峰行了个礼，表示大功告成。\n场面有些滑稽，不过角峰却忍不住为他鼓了两下掌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在家乡，其实我也有一副这样的自制义肢，要下地的时候，我就会用那副义肢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟，我平时用的那副可是狠下心花了大价钱买的，它倒也算是对得起那个价格，这些年都没出过什么大问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我常和我的手下们开玩笑说，在战场上出事了先救我的义肢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟它的价格快赶上我的抚恤金了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呵呵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的家乡，也有许多田野吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，和谢拉格不太一样，那里的田野是金色的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，有些东西是一样的，你不觉得吗，角峰先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g1_snowyforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "吁——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总算是差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "夕阳西下，哈洛德、角峰，还有农民们站在田埂间看着他们一个下午的成果，都忍不住长吁了一口气。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做这种事总是很有成就感，对吧，角峰先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然......我只是没想到，你这样的维多利亚贵族，也会和我有一样的感慨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，可别因此对维多利亚贵族产生期待，你会失望的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你为什么会是维多利亚贵族？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是个好问题，角峰先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就好像每一个开斯特家族的人都在哀叹，为什么恩希欧迪斯老爷是一个谢拉格人一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们总是无法解释这些问题，最后，只能归结于命运的玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "角峰先生，下次恩希欧迪斯老爷路过我们郡的时候，请一定和我打一声招呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会请我的夫人亲自下厨，为你们做一顿维多利亚家常菜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然后，你可以和恩希欧迪斯老爷一起在那里住一段时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到时候，我就可以让你们听一听我家乡的歌谣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "哈洛德说着，轻轻哼唱起了属于他家乡的歌谣。\n旁边的几个农民听到哈洛德哼的歌谣后，忍不住也哼起了谢拉格的民谣。\n不知不觉间，就变成了你一首维多利亚歌谣，我一首谢拉格民谣的田野歌唱大会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g1_snowyforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天这么热闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯，你又来送信啦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这歌有点耳熟，但好像又不太一样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有个维多利亚老头也在一起唱呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "围观的村民",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唱得还挺好听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "维多利亚老头？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "魏斯循着歌声看去，只见哈洛德正在给一位老乡的引吭高歌打拍子。\n他的神情变幻了几下，最终归于平淡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g1_snowyforest"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯那边，我会帮你说两句，但我不保证他会听。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他的性格如此，希望你能理解。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他和我年轻的时候比，可要好相处多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来不用我帮忙了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您早知道结局是那样，一开始又何必惺惺作态？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯先生，士兵从来没有问心无愧以及请求被害者原谅的资格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我只能这么说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我确实很喜欢谢拉格这片土地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果可能，我希望它能好好的。未来，我想和我的家人一起再来这里看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我正好顺路，要去给那位工匠小姐送货。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_198_blackd_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你跟得上的话就来吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "魏斯说完转身就走。\n但他并没有发挥他敏捷的身手几下跳到远处，只是用比常人稍快一些的步行速度向着雪山方向走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏斯他也很纠结。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁能不纠结呢，角峰先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老哈洛德也很纠结。只是，就像我断肢的部分时不时会隐隐作痛一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很少告诉别人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也没有人在乎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，回见，角峰先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？等等，哈洛德先生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老爷刚刚给我发消息，他说过几天要举办一场晚宴，想要邀请你出席，我和魏斯，还有锏也会来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来，我欠了人情的不只是锏女士，还有恩希欧迪斯老爷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（原本只是想借这个机会和罗德岛建立联系，现在看来，我明天递交入职申请恐怕都不成问题了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（那位大师的去向是你的手笔，对吧，恩希欧迪斯老爷。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（不，也不能这么说。只是我们想的一样，我去罗德岛，对你、对我、对谢拉格、对开斯特，都好。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "角峰",
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈洛德先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哈洛德",
      "speakerId": "avg_4114_harold_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请转告恩希欧迪斯老爷，老哈洛德届时一定带上好酒，我们不醉不归！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_199_yak",
      "aliases": [
        "角峰"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
